{"ref":"BDB, אֶלְעָזָר","hw":"אֶלְעָזָר","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶלְעָזָר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>God has helped</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר\" href=\"/BDB,_אֱלִיעֶ֫זֶר\", dir=\"rtl\">אֱלִיעֶזֶר</a> supr.<strong>) </strong><br><strong>a.</strong>  Eleazar the priest <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:23\" href=\"/Exodus.6.23\">Ex 6:23</a> + (50 times in Hex) <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:28\" href=\"/Judges.20.28\">Ju 20:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.29\">1 Ch 5:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:35\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.35\">6:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.20\">9:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.1\">24:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.2\">2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.4\">4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.6\">6</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:5\" href=\"/Ezra.7.5\">Ezr 7:5</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  son of Abinadab <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.1\">1 S 7:1</a>.<br><strong>c.</strong>  one of David’s heroes <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.9\">2 S 23:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.12\">1 Ch 11:12</a>; ins. also <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.4\">1 Ch 27:4</a> cf. Dr<sup>Sm 280</sup>.<br><strong>d.</strong>  a Levite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:21\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.21\">1 Ch 23:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.28\">24:28</a>.<br><strong>e.</strong>  priest of the time of Ezra <a data-ref=\"Ezra 8:33\" href=\"/Ezra.8.33\">Ezr 8:33</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:42\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.42\">Ne 12:42</a>.<br><strong>f.</strong>  one of the line of Parosh <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:25\" href=\"/Ezra.10.25\">Ezr 10:25</a>.","next":"BDB, אֶלְעָלֵא","prev":"BDB, אֶלְעוּזַי"}